---

Fork notice: @local/dsh-wallpaper is a fork of @frog755/dsh-wallpaper 0.4.0
(https://github.com/Frog755/dsh-wallpaper), also MIT licensed. The upstream
copyright notices above are retained per the MIT license. This fork adapts the
plugin for a local DeepSeek Harness 0.1.1-rc.2 deployment: MP4/ffmpeg video
support is removed (static images only), the fixed port-9191 webserver patch
is removed, images are stored under ~/.dsh/wallpapers instead of browser
localStorage data URLs, and configuration persists in the host settings
document via the `wallpaper` settings namespace, with per-page overrides,
a dark mask layer, and URL / absolute-path image sources.
